        'prestige.pkg.abundancia.name': 'Age of Abundance',
        'prestige.pkg.abundancia.desc': 'Manual gathering yields ×2 and its radius is ×2 from the very first click. Building donations grant 2 instead of 1, and every road skill gives double. +10 additional starting roads.',
        'prestige.pkg.banca.name':      'Royal Bank',
        'prestige.pkg.banca.desc':      'You start with the City Market unlocked and FREE, plus 1,000 gold to invest right away. Mules deliver ×2 gold and the Tax Office collects ×2. +10 additional starting roads.',

