        'ritual.chat.1.mule_a':         'Well, {name}... gotta say, you pulled that cart without complaining once.',
        'ritual.chat.1.mule_b':         'Well, {name}... honestly, always the most obedient mule in the stable.',
        'ritual.chat.1.mule_c':         'Well, {name}... how many sacks of grain did you haul without a single complaint...',
        'ritual.chat.2':                'And now you\'ve been chosen by... the boss... lucky you!',
        'ritual.chat.3':                'Anyone else feel weird doing this before lunch?',
        'ritual.chat.4':                'They told me we\'d just be chopping down a forest...',
        'ritual.chat.5':                'Is this going on my record? Not thrilled about that.',
        'ritual.chat.6':                '{name}, relax, they say you don\'t feel a thing. Well... that\'s what they say.',
        'ritual.chat.7':                'It\'s harder on us than it is on you, trust me.',
        'ritual.chat.8':                'The boss claimed you, we\'re just following orders.',
        'ritual.chat.9':                'Anyway, enough chatter, they\'re watching us right now...',
        'ritual.chat.10':               'Oh eternal shadows, accept {name}... or whatever!',
